$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Deus Sanguinius\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Dry\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Afternoon\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other for control of Alpha Hercules XI, a cold, inhospitable world, even by Starwolf standards.  Each team must capture the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base.  The first team with 10 captures shall be the victor!\n\n<f1>Map by: <f0>[UM] InCoMiNg";
